    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26766" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διηθ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>strain through, filter,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Acut.</u>
				7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Sph.</u>
				226b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ti.</u>
				45c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶνον δ. πυρέττοντι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.101c
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Mim.Oxy.</u>
				413.161
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				368a22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				34.9.10
			</span></i>; of air in the lungs, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				2.705
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθαρὸν καὶ διηθημένον
			[γένος</span>], opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μικτόν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>wash out, cleanse,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν κοιλίην οἴνῳ, θυμιήμασι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.86
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr., of
			liquid, <i>filter through, percolate,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				2.93
			</span></i>.</div>
